{
    "id":  26795,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "COB LED Strip 220V 240 LED/m 10W/m 50m CRI90 IP65 1200 lm/m Cut every 10cm",
    "reference":  "SP240CORAC-CW-91507-50M",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e220V COB LED strip, \u003cstrong\u003e50 meters and 10W/m\u003c/strong\u003e, with a \u003cstrong\u003ecut-to-size option\u003c/strong\u003e, designed to deliver continuous, powerful, professional lighting. Its \u003cstrong\u003eCOB technology with 240 LED/m\u003c/strong\u003e provides uniform light with no visible dots, while its \u003cstrong\u003e120 lm/W and CRI90\u003c/strong\u003e ensure high efficiency and natural color rendering. At \u003cstrong\u003e10 mm wide\u003c/strong\u003e, it runs directly on 220V without a transformer and can be cut every \u003cstrong\u003e10 cm\u003c/strong\u003e. Its \u003cstrong\u003eIP65\u003c/strong\u003e rating makes it ideal for indoor and protected outdoor installations.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eCOB LED Strip 220V 10W/m | IP65 | Cut to Size\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e220V COB LED Strip with 10W/m\u003c/strong\u003e delivers continuous, uniform, professional lighting thanks to its \u003cstrong\u003eCOB technology with 240 LED/m\u003c/strong\u003e, which eliminates visible light dots. With an efficiency of \u003cstrong\u003e120 lm/W\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eCRI90\u003c/strong\u003e, it provides high brightness and natural color rendering.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAt \u003cstrong\u003e10 mm wide\u003c/strong\u003e, it runs directly on \u003cstrong\u003e220V with no transformer required\u003c/strong\u003e, simplifying installation. It can be \u003cstrong\u003ecut every 10 cm\u003c/strong\u003e and ordered \u003cstrong\u003eto size\u003c/strong\u003e, with a maximum length of \u003cstrong\u003e50 meters\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIts \u003cstrong\u003eIP65\u003c/strong\u003e rating allows use in indoor installations and protected outdoor applications, making it a versatile solution for decorative, architectural, and commercial lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey features\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePower:\u003c/strong\u003e 10W/m\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTechnology:\u003c/strong\u003e COB\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDensity:\u003c/strong\u003e 240 LED/m\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEfficiency:\u003c/strong\u003e 120 lm/W\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCRI:\u003c/strong\u003e 90\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVoltage:\u003c/strong\u003e 220V\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWidth:\u003c/strong\u003e 10 mm\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCutting:\u003c/strong\u003e every 10 cm\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaximum length:\u003c/strong\u003e 50 m\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProtection:\u003c/strong\u003e IP65\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCut to size:\u003c/strong\u003e select the meters you need\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eImportant purchase information\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1 unit equals 1 meter of LED strip.\u003c/strong\u003e Select the number of meters you need in the quantity field, up to a maximum of \u003cstrong\u003e50 meters\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003efull reel is 50 meters\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1 Kit 42004 connector is supplied per order\u003c/strong\u003e, regardless of the meters selected.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA connector is not included for each cut meter\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eUses and applications\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eIdeal for \u003cstrong\u003eindirect lighting, architectural decoration, shop windows, retail stores, hotels, restaurants, professional installations, and continuous LED lighting projects\u003c/strong\u003e requiring uniform light with no visible dots.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-efficiency, easy-to-install\u003c/strong\u003e solution for projects that need 220V LED strips in custom lengths.\u003c/p\u003e",
